{"id":48234,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/cross-trail-solidario-f-c-belenenses\/"},"modified":"2026-10-19T00:01:15","modified_gmt":"2026-10-18T23:01:15","slug":"cross-trail-solidario-f-c-belenenses","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/cross-trail-solidario-f-c-belenenses\/","title":{"rendered":"Cross Trail Solid\u00e1rio F.C. Belenenses 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Cross Trail Solid\u00e1rio F.C. Belenenses 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Cross Trail Solid\u00e1rio F.C. Belenenses 2026<\/strong> realiza-se a <strong>7 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com as partidas agendadas a partir das <strong>16:00<\/strong> na sede do clube na <strong>Marinha Grande<\/strong> (<strong>Leiria<\/strong>), o programa apresenta um Trail de <strong>17 km<\/strong> e uma Caminhada de <strong>8 km<\/strong>. O percurso alia beleza e t\u00e9cnica atrav\u00e9s dos caminhos e carreiros t\u00edpicos desta regi\u00e3o, fortemente marcada pela heran\u00e7a do hist\u00f3rico Pinhal do Rei (Pinhal de Leiria) e da sua emblem\u00e1tica tradi\u00e7\u00e3o vidreira.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Unindo a supera\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva a uma causa solid\u00e1ria, o evento \u00e9 oficialmente promovido pela associa\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>F.C. \u201cOs Belenenses\u201d<\/strong> em conjunto com a comunidade local, convidando os participantes para um conv\u00edvio final acompanhado pela tradicional Sopa da Pedra.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">7 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direc