padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">12.00\u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:10<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">9.00\u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio do Cross Trail Solid\u00e1rio F.C. Belenenses 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no dia 7 de Novembro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado), com o arranque da prova de 17 km \u00e0s 16:00, seguida da Caminhada \u00e0s 16:10.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde \u00e9 o local de partida da corrida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida e chegada ter\u00e3o lugar junto \u00e0 Sede do F.C. &#8216;Os Belenenses&#8217;, na Marinha Grande, no distrito de Leiria.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias oficiais dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa competitivo inclui um Cross Trail de aproximadamente 17 km, havendo ainda uma Caminhada na dist\u00e2ncia de 8 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada por Frederico Bernardino Cabral com o apoio oficial da associa\u00e7\u00e3o Futebol Clube &#8216;Os Belenenses&#8217;.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados e as fotografias da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o do evento, os resultados oficiais e os tempos dos atletas poder\u00e3o ser consultados no portal Portugal Running. As fotografias ser\u00e3o partilhadas pelas p\u00e1ginas oficiais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Cross Trail Solid\u00e1rio F.C. Belenenses 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sede do F.C. Os Belenenses, Marinha Grande\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Marinha Grande\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"F.C. Os Belenenses \/ Frederico Cabral\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio do Cross Trail Solid\u00e1rio F.C. Belenenses 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no dia 7 de Novembro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado), com o arranque da prova de 17 km \u00e0s 16:00, seguida da Caminhada \u00e0s 16:10.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde \u00e9 o local de partida da corrida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida e chegada ter\u00e3o lugar junto \u00e0 Sede do F.C. 'Os Belenenses', na Marinha Grande, no distrito de Leiria.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias oficiais dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa competitivo inclui um Cross Trail de aproximadamente 17 km, havendo ainda uma Caminhada na dist\u00e2ncia de 8 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada por Frederico Bernardino Cabral com o apoio oficial da associa\u00e7\u00e3o Futebol Clube 'Os Belenenses'.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar os resultados e as fotografias da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o do evento, os resultados oficiais e os tempos dos atletas poder\u00e3o ser consultados no portal Portugal Running. As fotografias ser\u00e3o partilhadas pelas p\u00e1ginas oficiais.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69491,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[38,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-48234","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-marinha-grande-leiria","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-leiria","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploa